><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"209.8573315719947\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"209.8573315719947\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"60.61095022624434,311.1764705882353 96.02051948051948,235.45454545454544 160.12900000000002,236.4 260.252,216.98666666666668 336.3557894736842,161.68421052631578 405.1684210526316,107.40350877192981\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 19% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 221 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"60.61095022624434\" cy=\"311.1764705882353\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 11%&amp;#10;It rained 40% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"96.02051948051948\" cy=\"235.45454545454544\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 29%&amp;#10;It rained 40% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 80 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"160.12900000000002\" cy=\"236.4\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 57%&amp;#10;It rained 45% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"260.252\" cy=\"216.98666666666668\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 79%&amp;#10;It rained 61% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"336.3557894736842\" cy=\"161.68421052631578\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 98%&amp;#10;It rained 75% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 228 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"405.1684210526316\" cy=\"107.40350877192981\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(47%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Leicester the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.12) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-0.28).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>68%</td><td class='num'>-0.280</td><td class='num'>24.1%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>37%</td><td class='num'>-0.137</td><td class='num'>24.0%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>57%</td><td class='num'>0.004</td><td class='num'>18.8%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>31%</td><td class='num'>0.125</td><td class='num'>12.9%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":52.6386,"lon":-1.13169,"n":757,"n_cities":134,"name":"Leicester","offset_days":1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.06,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.007375565610859728,"n":221,"obs":0.19457013574660634,"sig":true},{"hi":0.2,"lo":0.06,"mean":0.1074025974025974,"n":77,"obs":0.4025974025974026